{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will meet</b> — two times in the Masorah: ונועדתי לך and ונועדתי שמה לבני ישראל. This is what they expounded: \"which YHWH spoke, saying, 'I will be sanctified through them that come near Me'\" — and where did He speak? \"I will be sanctified in My glory.\" Moses said to Aaron: I knew that the Tabernacle would be sanctified through those near the Place, and I thought it would be sanctified through me. From where did he know? From here, for He said to him ונועדתי לך — meaning, through you. Therefore here it is written ונועדתי לך and below ונועדתי שמה לבני ישראל." "<b>From between the two cherubim</b> — ר\"ת משה (Moses)."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:25.492241774Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}